[0.000, "o", "\r\nWHAT THE DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINED\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  correct verdict: NO CAUSE -- the evidence cannot establish one\r\n  planted cause: Signups did step down in mid-June and the only candidate is a copy deploy merged on 2026-06-16. Nothing connects them: no comparable unaffected series, no experiment, no error report, and the deploy did not touch the signup path. The movement is established; its cause is not.\r\n  decoys placed to mislead: caused by the deploy, the deploy caused, driven by the deploy\r\n  signals a correct answer names: any of [2026-06-16, 2026-06-17, 16 June, 17 June, June 16, June 17], any of [copy, deploy, 812]\r\n"]
